  message: "SCOPE NARROWED BY ONE: graphql-linker is settled, in PR #1025 under WI-dinum.\n\nIts clause named six HOST languages (javascript/python/java/ruby/go + graphql)\nwhile the linker reads source files itself and consumes no host analyzer's\noutput. Repaired to [[\"graphql\", \"graphql-sdl-linker\"]] -- the two passes that\ncan supply an edge DESTINATION. That is the shape this row proposes for the\nfamily: name what supplies the destination, not where the source pattern was\nfound.\n\nStill on this row: database-query-linker (the filed instance),\ngraphql-resolver-linker, event_sourcing, message_queue, subprocess_cli, http,\ncrypto_flow."  # f06d
